  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RENEWABLE ENERGY ACCESS FOR VULNERABLE HOUSEHOLDS DCD 36576 SLE.TROCAIRE.2024.01</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s long-term aim is to provide energy as a service (EaaS) to all households unconnected to electricity grid systems. In the short term, the project will  provide  renewable Tier 1 energy services to 11,800 households in Kambia District under an EaaS model. solar lamps with charging capacity to poorest 10% of communities who cannot afford EaaS, and the development of a business model for the long-term delivery of energy services to off-grid households using an EaaS model.</narrative>
  </description>
